WEBVTT

00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:05.050
<i>When we get older, let's sing PriPara together-nano!</i>

00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:13.950
<i>My birthdate is June 6th.</i>

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:16.530
Mine is June 6th, too...

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:21.870
Devidevi! Throw wide the gates of darkness!

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:23.260
Devi!

00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:27.130
Aloma did a great job playing the role of a demon.

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:31.970
<i> Huh? Become demon and angel idols?</i>

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:33.570
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:00:33.570 --> 00:00:36.590
<i>One day we shall rule over PriPara.</i>

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:38.030
<i>Okay-nano!</i>

00:00:38.030 --> 00:00:42.530
<i>If that's what you want, we shall play demon and angel together!</i>

00:00:44.990 --> 00:00:47.760
That's why that picture's so precious to us-nano.

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:50.090
We'll treasure it forever-nano.

00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:26.920
Keep it a Secret From Aloma-nano!

00:02:29.450 --> 00:02:31.630
I'm against it-pri!

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:35.860
If we form a team with Aloma and Mikan it won't end well-pri.

00:02:35.860 --> 00:02:36.960
But...

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:40.040
It would really complicate things-kuma.

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:41.680
Did something happen-kuma?

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:43.530
Something like Aloma talking down to you?

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:44.300
Of course not!

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:44.960
I take it back.

00:02:44.960 --> 00:02:44.970
Of course not!

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:47.200
Not really...

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:52.340
I see. So thou wouldst like to team up with us?

00:02:52.340 --> 00:02:55.230
Thou hast finally given into my magic.

00:02:55.230 --> 00:02:58.200
It seems that would make thee PriPara's rat.

00:02:58.200 --> 00:03:01.700
Hence all thou should be saying is
"A pop and a step and a squeak squeak".

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:04.790
That'd be terrible-pri!

00:03:04.790 --> 00:03:06.540
There's no way I could handle it-pri!

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:10.420
But you did praise Aloma-chan that one time.

00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:11.540
Uh...

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:14.810
Well, she does have her good points-pri.

00:03:14.810 --> 00:03:18.180
I used to say that it's weird for an angel and demon to get along,

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:20.300
but in reality they get along really well.

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:25.140
It doesn't seem like they get into arguments, either.

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:28.250
Those two arguing?

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:30.230
You're kidding, right?!

00:03:30.230 --> 00:03:33.860
Well, Mirelle, you should really think it over-kuma.

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:36.580
And while you do that, we'll go find out what they think-kuma.

00:03:36.580 --> 00:03:38.960
Let's go talk to them-kuma.

00:03:38.960 --> 00:03:40.240
Capisce!

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:41.110
Yeah.

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:43.110
Hold on!

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:46.240
Usa!

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:47.820
Usa-usa!

00:03:47.820 --> 00:03:51.120
My all hearing ears are issuing a warning-usa!

00:03:52.410 --> 00:03:54.460
I've caught an emergency signal-usa!

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:55.620
What?

00:03:55.620 --> 00:03:59.130
SoLaMi Smile is on their way to talk to Alomagedon-usa!

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:00.750
Wha'd you say?!

00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:03.380
So they had the same idea?

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:05.340
Let's do it before them!

00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:07.560
If you say so, Dorthy...

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:08.860
Let's strike while the iron's hot!

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:10.520
Let's Go!

00:04:18.130 --> 00:04:22.330
"The once-sealed door to the palace shall soon be opened.

00:04:22.330 --> 00:04:26.990
The angel and demon who hold the key shall divide heaven and earth.

00:04:26.990 --> 00:04:32.460
Dream Alomagedon shall release a great surprise upon PriPara."

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:37.000
What dost thou think, Mikan? Mysterious, isn't it?

00:04:37.740 --> 00:04:38.420
Huh?

00:04:42.500 --> 00:04:43.770
Oh, that's right.

00:04:43.770 --> 00:04:48.550
Mikan said she had things to take care of today so I should head home without her.

00:05:02.640 --> 00:05:04.170
What about Sunday?

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:05.720
Oh, you were invited too?

00:05:05.720 --> 00:05:08.020
Yeah, then we should invite Azusa, too.

00:05:08.020 --> 00:05:09.270
Good idea.

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:12.580
Nano.

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:14.080
Mikan!

00:05:14.900 --> 00:05:15.570
Gel...

00:05:15.570 --> 00:05:17.250
What happened, Mikan?
Gel...

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:19.660
Thou said thou had things to take care of
and to head home without thee.

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:21.260
Ah, Aloma!

00:05:21.260 --> 00:05:23.880
Mikan is hungry and her stomach's all grumbly-nano.

00:05:24.370 --> 00:05:26.840
She used all her energy during gym today.

00:05:27.260 --> 00:05:29.850
But what about the things thou had to do?

00:05:29.850 --> 00:05:31.260
Well...

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:31.810
Ah!

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:35.330
A sandwich-nano!

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:37.730
Hey! Come on!

00:05:38.310 --> 00:05:39.690
Guess I'll have to.

00:05:40.110 --> 00:05:44.000
I shall procure the corpse of a swine wrapped in white skin for thee.

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:46.670
Thanks for getting a pork bun!

00:05:46.670 --> 00:05:48.920
Wait there, I'll be back momentarily.

00:05:48.920 --> 00:05:51.690
May you have heaven's blessing, Aloma-nano.

00:05:51.690 --> 00:05:53.660
I need not that blessing.

00:05:58.300 --> 00:05:59.580
Gel?

00:06:00.570 --> 00:06:03.240
Mikan, you're late-nekon!

00:06:03.240 --> 00:06:05.410
Tomorrow is Aloma's birthday!

00:06:05.410 --> 00:06:08.620
Come on, we need to get started on the party planning-nekon.

00:06:08.620 --> 00:06:10.800
I'll delay it another thirty minutes-nekon.

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:13.450
Mikan's starving and can't move.

00:06:13.450 --> 00:06:16.020
Don't you want to make Aloma happy-nekon?

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:16.850
Ah!

00:06:16.850 --> 00:06:18.810
Mikan will do her best!

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:21.520
But most importantly, you want to make it a surprise, right-nekon?

00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:23.320
So keep it a secret from Aloma.

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:24.860
G-Got it!

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:26.780
Mikan won't say anything to Aloma.

00:06:28.040 --> 00:06:30.000
Anything at all-nano...

00:06:31.180 --> 00:06:34.510
Five pork buns please.

00:06:34.510 --> 00:06:35.750
Sure thing.

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:39.130
Crap! I only have seven yen.

00:06:39.130 --> 00:06:41.860
This isn't even enough to take a ferry across the River Styx.

00:06:41.860 --> 00:06:43.670
What should I do?!

00:06:44.440 --> 00:06:45.680
I've found the demon.

00:06:45.680 --> 00:06:46.630
Hey!

00:06:47.070 --> 00:06:49.090
We'd like to talk with you.

00:06:49.560 --> 00:06:51.730
We were just looking for you.

00:06:51.730 --> 00:06:55.300
The Summer GranPri will be starting in a few weeks.

00:06:55.300 --> 00:07:00.560
With that, how about forming a five person Dream Team with us?

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:03.810
I-I see.  So ye have finally come around.

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:05.300
Yes, yes! Let us do it together.

00:07:05.300 --> 00:07:07.280
But first, Mikan is in grave danger!

00:07:07.280 --> 00:07:08.170
Huh?

00:07:08.170 --> 00:07:11.650
If I don't get her foodstuff soon, she'll become a shrivelled angel.

00:07:11.650 --> 00:07:12.740
Shrivelled?

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:16.080
I see. So that will happen?

00:07:16.390 --> 00:07:19.940
Then you should come to our okonomiyaki restaurant.

00:07:19.940 --> 00:07:22.040
After all, it's nearby.

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:27.210
So? Has this sated your appetite a little?

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:32.680
A little bit.

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:34.930
Then we should get started-nekon.

00:07:36.510 --> 00:07:37.180
Ah!

00:07:37.180 --> 00:07:37.890
Gel?

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:39.800
We finally found you!

00:07:39.800 --> 00:07:41.100
We've been looking for you.

00:07:41.580 --> 00:07:45.310
Mega-neesan told us you went to Overlook Cafe.

00:07:45.830 --> 00:07:49.640
We came to ask you about forming a Dream Team with us.

00:07:49.640 --> 00:07:53.140
Sophie will perform a dance to convey our true feelings.

00:07:53.140 --> 00:07:56.280
I want to try being a jellyfish angel.

00:07:56.630 --> 00:07:58.220
That's great!

00:07:58.220 --> 00:08:00.100
So you've finally decided-nano?

00:08:00.100 --> 00:08:02.000
I'm in full support-nekon.

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:05.710
I'm sure Aloma wouldn't object either-nekon.

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:07.340
Hooray!

00:08:07.340 --> 00:08:10.080
Now all we need to do is get Mirelle's approval.

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:10.670
Yeah.

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:12.000
Oh, that's right!

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:14.560
Since we're going to form a Dream Team...

00:08:15.350 --> 00:08:16.440
Eh?!

00:08:16.440 --> 00:08:18.600
Tomorrow is Aloma-chan's birthday?!

00:08:19.250 --> 00:08:22.340
She was born at exactly 6 o'clock on June 6th.

00:08:22.340 --> 00:08:24.070
6 6 6.

00:08:24.070 --> 00:08:26.560
She truly is the poster child of the devil.

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:29.320
We want to throw her a huge party-nano!

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:31.310
We have a lot of decorations and other things to put up,

00:08:31.310 --> 00:08:34.780
and since we're forming a Dream Team,
why don't you help us out-nekon?

00:08:35.420 --> 00:08:36.530
Capisce!

00:08:39.740 --> 00:08:40.660
Red ogre!

00:08:41.220 --> 00:08:42.370
Blue ogre!

00:08:42.730 --> 00:08:45.080
And I'm Ushioni, the cow ogre.

00:08:45.080 --> 00:08:47.550
So what do you think of our demon costumes?

00:08:47.550 --> 00:08:48.930
Wrong genre.

00:08:48.930 --> 00:08:50.040
Huh?

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:52.570
I'll explain it some other time.

00:08:52.570 --> 00:08:53.800
So where's the foodstuff?

00:08:54.430 --> 00:08:56.750
Here's our Pig & Rice special.

00:08:56.750 --> 00:08:59.510
It's the closest thing we have to a pork bun.

00:08:59.930 --> 00:09:01.160
I'll make one for you.

00:09:01.160 --> 00:09:02.650
I'll make it.

00:09:02.650 --> 00:09:05.180
Mikan has only eaten that which I have given her.

00:09:05.180 --> 00:09:06.220
Eh?

00:09:06.220 --> 00:09:07.480
You sure are good friends.

00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:11.200
You're not mixing it?!

00:09:11.200 --> 00:09:14.650
Could this be the first time you've made okonomiyaki?

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:16.040
Devi!

00:09:16.040 --> 00:09:17.690
Don't take a demon lightly!

00:09:17.690 --> 00:09:22.370
For someone 660,011 years old such as myself,
nothing in this world is unbeknownst to me.

00:09:22.840 --> 00:09:25.240
Let's start with the cake-nekon.

00:09:25.240 --> 00:09:26.600
Okay!

00:09:26.600 --> 00:09:31.580
Whisk together the milk and eggs to make the sponge-nekon.

00:09:31.580 --> 00:09:34.760
Over here you'll be making the decorations to top it with-nekon.

00:09:34.760 --> 00:09:36.230
E-Eh?!

00:09:36.230 --> 00:09:37.470
These are the toppings?!

00:09:37.770 --> 00:09:39.910
Aloma is a demon-nekon.

00:09:39.910 --> 00:09:46.670
Decorating the cake with things like chocolate centipedes, pillbug cookies, or bat wings will go over big with her-nekon!

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:51.770
That's right.

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:53.100
Yes. Keep it up!

00:09:53.100 --> 00:09:54.920
How is this worth praising?!

00:09:54.920 --> 00:09:56.070
Praise me instead!

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:00.280
The first one is done, but...

00:10:00.940 --> 00:10:03.400
...there's still something left to be desired-nekon.

00:10:03.400 --> 00:10:05.050
Y-You think?

00:10:05.050 --> 00:10:07.290
I think it has plenty of impact...

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:08.660
No! Not quite!

00:10:08.660 --> 00:10:12.000
It needs to be more stylish for someone like Aloma, don't you think?

00:10:12.410 --> 00:10:14.460
<i>Just what does she have in mind?</i>

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:41.200
<i>I realise she isn't a bad kid, but...</i>

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:45.040
<i>I wonder if things would turn out okay if we form a Dream Team.</i>

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:50.380
<i>It'll be really hard to accept that cocky attitude day in and day out.</i>

00:10:51.610 --> 00:10:55.670
<i>I want to treasure each and every concert I'm in.</i>

00:10:55.670 --> 00:10:58.170
<i>If she doesn't share those feelings,</i>

00:10:58.170 --> 00:11:00.220
<i>forming a team would be pointless.</i>

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:12.450
<i>Just what is she thinking?</i>

00:11:13.750 --> 00:11:16.680
<i>Did she really write all these?</i>

00:11:16.680 --> 00:11:17.610
<i>I'm impressed.</i>

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:22.750
<i>Wow! She wrote this much?!</i>

00:11:24.500 --> 00:11:28.700
<i>So it's six notebooks enclosed in one binder.</i>

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:33.980
<i>She put a lot of effort into building her demon character every day.</i>

00:11:33.980 --> 00:11:37.820
<i>And it's precisely because she did this year in year out...</i>

00:11:37.820 --> 00:11:41.630
<i>...that she could make it all the way to
Promising Rookie shortly after her début.</i>

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:45.850
<i>Your character image with all pri this and pri that is the most shallow of all!</i>

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:49.820
<i>Of course I understand why she said that!</i>

00:11:49.820 --> 00:11:53.010
<i>But if she thinks it's a shallow character,</i>

00:11:53.010 --> 00:11:55.560
<i>why does it seem like she wants to form a Dream Team with us?</i>

00:11:56.870 --> 00:11:59.820
<i>Amazing. These aren't just prophecies,</i>

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:02.460
<i>they are pinups for PriPara concerts as well!</i>

00:12:02.460 --> 00:12:04.780
<i>There's one for SoLaMi Smile, Dressing Parfait...</i>

00:12:06.230 --> 00:12:08.490
<i>This one's from my solo concert!</i>

00:12:08.490 --> 00:12:11.530
<i>Mirelle doesn't have the smarts to say anything other than pri this and pri that.</i>

00:12:11.530 --> 00:12:15.000
<i>I want to change her "pri" to "bri" with one of my curses.</i>

00:12:16.450 --> 00:12:18.420
<i>But it was still a wonderful concert.</i>

00:12:21.100 --> 00:12:23.880
<i>Mirelle is the best pop idol!</i>

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:29.520
<i>That's because she can make her viewer's hearts pop and dance.</i>

00:12:29.520 --> 00:12:32.850
<i>She even got my blood pumping.</i>

00:12:35.810 --> 00:12:38.070
<i>Thank you-pri!</i>

00:12:39.030 --> 00:12:42.210
<i>Mirelle is the hardest working idol.</i>

00:12:42.210 --> 00:12:43.970
<i>She doesn't miss a day of practice.</i>

00:12:43.970 --> 00:12:46.070
<i>I won't forget the effort she puts into it.</i>

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:50.560
Pushuu~.

00:12:50.560 --> 00:12:52.460
I'm tired.

00:12:52.460 --> 00:12:54.980
You should be more honest.

00:12:57.730 --> 00:13:00.000
Mirelle, have you made up your mind?

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:02.520
Yeah, it's fine.

00:13:02.520 --> 00:13:05.450
Let's form a five person team with Alomagedon.

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:07.160
They're no different than us.

00:13:07.160 --> 00:13:09.620
I finally understand that we'll all work hard when we're together.

00:13:09.620 --> 00:13:10.330
Hooray!

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:12.730
That's the Mirelle I know! I love you!

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:15.500
All right, that side's done, Aloma!

00:13:15.500 --> 00:13:16.440
Now flip it over!

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:24.860
So, are you sure this isn't your first go at grilling okonomiyaki?

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:27.380
T'was only a slip of the hand!

00:13:27.380 --> 00:13:31.120
There's nothing a 660,011 year old demon cannot do!

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:31.830
Next one!

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:35.780
I see. It's for her birthday-pri?

00:13:35.780 --> 00:13:38.290
If that's the case, I'll be glad to help-pri.

00:13:39.770 --> 00:13:42.930
Now that Mirelle's helping, there's nothing to worry about.

00:13:42.930 --> 00:13:43.760
Yeah.
Nano!

00:13:44.230 --> 00:13:46.410
First you add the eggs-pri.

00:13:46.410 --> 00:13:47.470
Capisce!
Right!

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:48.450
Huh?

00:13:48.450 --> 00:13:50.680
But we had a ton of eggs just a moment ago...

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:53.830
Mikan never gets tired of eggs over rice!

00:13:53.830 --> 00:13:56.200
Really, Mikan?!

00:13:56.200 --> 00:14:00.110
Next we'll put the biscuits in a plastic bag and smash them into pieces-pri.

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:03.570
Huh? I just warmed the biscuits up a moment ago...

00:14:05.100 --> 00:14:06.900
Delicious!

00:14:08.810 --> 00:14:11.490
Wait! We still need to use that!

00:14:12.790 --> 00:14:14.500
Stop that-nekon!

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:19.180
Why are you capisce with eating everything?!

00:14:19.180 --> 00:14:21.090
It was a mistake-nano! A mistake-nano!

00:14:21.510 --> 00:14:23.510
Must endure!

00:14:23.510 --> 00:14:34.060
This is the special cake for Aloma-nano!

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:34.590
*stare*

00:14:34.590 --> 00:14:36.290
Let's remake it-nekon.
*stare*

00:14:36.290 --> 00:14:37.040
Pri!
*stare*

00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:38.190
Capisce!
*stare*

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:42.590
Mikan can't!

00:14:42.590 --> 00:14:43.480
Here.

00:14:46.060 --> 00:14:48.280
It's a Red Flash rice ball.

00:14:48.280 --> 00:14:51.060
Thank you-nano!

00:14:51.060 --> 00:14:54.620
Mikan will be able to hold out with this...

00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:56.470
Maybe.

00:14:57.200 --> 00:14:59.290
Faster. Faster!

00:15:00.030 --> 00:15:02.500
Mikan is waiting there starving!

00:15:02.980 --> 00:15:06.050
Mikan only eats what I give her.

00:15:08.890 --> 00:15:10.440
It's done!

00:15:10.440 --> 00:15:14.720
A cake with purple food colouring is Aloma's favourite.

00:15:16.690 --> 00:15:18.540
She did it!

00:15:18.540 --> 00:15:22.220
Since we ate all the ones you messed up,

00:15:22.220 --> 00:15:23.940
there's nothing to worry about.

00:15:23.940 --> 00:15:26.250
Hooray! Hooray!

00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:28.980
All that's left is to add the strawberries and it'll be complete!

00:15:28.980 --> 00:15:30.010
Hooray!

00:15:30.010 --> 00:15:32.440
Well done, ladies-nekon.

00:15:32.440 --> 00:15:34.910
With this, we're ready for tomorrow's party-nekon.

00:15:35.460 --> 00:15:39.610
Sophie-chan, Lala-chan, Mirelle-chan...

00:15:39.610 --> 00:15:41.020
Thank you-nano!

00:15:41.020 --> 00:15:45.380
Mikan will be able to give Aloma the best
birthday present ever thanks to you.

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:48.790
I-It's not like I did it for Aloma-pri.

00:15:48.790 --> 00:15:51.290
You sounded just like Aloma.

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:51.880
What?!

00:15:52.740 --> 00:15:54.060
Yeah, just like her!

00:15:54.060 --> 00:15:54.640
Yeah.

00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:56.760
Wai-  Man...!

00:15:58.530 --> 00:16:00.140
Our charms rang-pri.

00:16:00.140 --> 00:16:01.100
You're right.

00:16:01.430 --> 00:16:03.720
But they're not that bright.

00:16:03.720 --> 00:16:04.980
Nano.

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:09.160
Going off in unison is a sign of a Dream Team-nekon.

00:16:09.160 --> 00:16:10.560
You're almost there-nekon.

00:16:10.560 --> 00:16:15.200
Anyway, isn't it about time for your concert, SoLaMi Smile?

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:17.320
Ah, you're right!
Ah, you're right-pri!

00:16:17.320 --> 00:16:19.400
You're pretty reliable, Neko-san.

00:16:19.400 --> 00:16:24.670
As an Excellent Manager,
I've memorized the day's schedule-nekon.

00:16:24.670 --> 00:16:30.130
Now then, show me a concert full of your Dream Team aspirations-nekon.

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:31.270
Right!

00:16:33.720 --> 00:16:36.490
Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:16:37.720 --> 00:16:40.140
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:43.820
Coord Change Start!

00:16:48.870 --> 00:16:56.080
SoLaMi Smile will be performing in their Dream Heart Race Coord that's popular amongst all the girls in PriPara.

00:16:57.010 --> 00:17:01.450
Show off your cute bellybutton,
go out there and put on a super peppy concert!

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:04.160
Dream Heart Race Coord!

00:17:57.940 --> 00:18:00.650
I hope that Mikan-chan's feelings...

00:18:00.650 --> 00:18:01.770
...and the cake...

00:18:01.770 --> 00:18:03.520
...reach Aloma-pri!

00:18:05.480 --> 00:18:08.810
Making Drama Switch On!

00:18:11.320 --> 00:18:13.340
I'm starving.

00:18:13.340 --> 00:18:15.320
Pushuu~.

00:18:15.320 --> 00:18:17.320
Leave it to me-pri!

00:18:20.310 --> 00:18:21.690
Let's start it!

00:18:21.690 --> 00:18:24.430
The Good Friends Sweets Party!

00:18:26.380 --> 00:18:29.210
Cyalume Change!

00:19:13.520 --> 00:19:15.300
SoLaMi Smile is the best!

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:18.890
Do your best at your Dream Theatre concert!

00:19:22.840 --> 00:19:25.720
Sorry I took so long, Mikan!

00:19:25.720 --> 00:19:28.150
Huh? What?

00:19:28.150 --> 00:19:29.700
Where did she go?

00:19:29.700 --> 00:19:30.910
Is something wrong?

00:19:30.910 --> 00:19:32.190
She's not here?

00:19:32.590 --> 00:19:34.130
Mikan...

00:19:34.130 --> 00:19:36.290
Was she carried off by wild dogs?!

00:19:36.290 --> 00:19:37.610
No way.

00:19:45.580 --> 00:19:47.620
Are you all right, Aloma?

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:49.280
You can take a short...

00:19:49.280 --> 00:19:50.290
...break.

00:20:00.350 --> 00:20:02.200
We finished our concert-pri.

00:20:02.200 --> 00:20:03.340
Is the cake done?

00:20:03.340 --> 00:20:04.550
Wha?!

00:20:09.530 --> 00:20:11.420
Waah! Mikan ate it!

00:20:11.420 --> 00:20:13.270
Ate it-nano!

00:20:13.270 --> 00:20:14.730
Crap-nekon!

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:17.340
She couldn't stop herself from eating it!

00:20:17.340 --> 00:20:19.190
Aloma's cake is...

00:20:23.970 --> 00:20:25.370
Oh well.

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:28.110
Sorry-nano!

00:20:28.110 --> 00:20:29.960
Want to make another?

00:20:29.960 --> 00:20:31.580
Okay! Let's make another!

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:34.740
But this time, we'll all eat it together!

00:20:34.740 --> 00:20:35.790
Capisce!

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:40.010
I suppose you <i>do</i> need to taste test it-pri.

00:20:42.290 --> 00:20:43.420
Delicious, huh?

00:20:43.420 --> 00:20:45.050
Mikan wants to eat more!

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:46.930
You sure do eat a lot-pri.

00:20:54.010 --> 00:20:55.390
Aloma!

00:20:55.900 --> 00:20:56.860
Mikan!

00:20:56.860 --> 00:20:57.890
You're here with SoLaMi Smile-

00:20:57.890 --> 00:20:58.860
Don't-nano!

00:20:58.860 --> 00:21:00.820
This is a secret-nano!

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:02.400
Don't look!

00:21:02.400 --> 00:21:03.580
What are you saying?!

00:21:03.580 --> 00:21:07.030
Besides, thou are accepting food from someone other than me!

00:21:07.030 --> 00:21:09.020
M-Mikan is...

00:21:09.020 --> 00:21:10.800
Hold on, Aloma.

00:21:10.800 --> 00:21:14.750
When Mikan is hungry, she'll accept food from anyone...

00:21:17.800 --> 00:21:19.960
Alomagedon is no more!

00:21:21.300 --> 00:21:24.060
Angels and demons divide heaven and earth.

00:21:24.060 --> 00:21:27.680
You shall be cursed for all eternity!

00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:29.640
Derodero derosaimu!

00:21:29.640 --> 00:21:30.850
Aloma!

00:23:06.050 --> 00:23:07.480
Aloma-chan, wait!

00:23:07.480 --> 00:23:09.490
Mikan-chan was doing it for you!

00:23:09.490 --> 00:23:10.780
That's enough!

00:23:10.780 --> 00:23:12.780
Heaven and earth have been divided!

00:23:12.780 --> 00:23:16.750
PriPara shall now play host to the final battle between angels and demons!

00:23:16.750 --> 00:23:18.200
Final battle?!

00:23:18.200 --> 00:23:20.670
It's Mikan's fault Aloma is upset.

00:23:20.670 --> 00:23:23.920
Mikan will try making a heartfelt present once more!

00:23:23.920 --> 00:23:25.090
Capisce!

00:23:25.090 --> 00:23:26.780
We'll cheer you on!

00:23:26.780 --> 00:23:29.040
No way! It's not happening! You can't make me!

00:23:29.040 --> 00:23:29.700
Next time:

00:23:29.700 --> 00:23:31.920
June 6th, Idol Breakup!

00:23:31.920 --> 00:23:33.240
Aim for your dreams!

00:23:33.240 --> 00:23:34.760
Let's go PriPara!
